  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In Fedora 5 when you try to PUT or PATCH to add a managed type it throws an Exception, even when the server is in RELAXED mode for updated some server managed properties.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora 6 just ignores these triples silently, which could be a feature but is also a deviation from Fedora 5 behaviour.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
